31:- An adapter epoch can discard a late response but cannot stop a delayed native activation from overwriting newer intent. Rust must admit/order/recheck activation before, during, and after slow work.
34:- Main-window `Destroyed` is too late for graceful async shutdown. `WindowEvent::CloseRequested` and `RunEvent::ExitRequested` must prevent exit while one bounded coordinator disposes SSH and existing Browser Debug resources.
